WEBVTT

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:21.390
This can't be happening; I clasp my head in my hands

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:27.980
As I struggle with my desire to escape from this saturated world.

00:00:28.810 --> 00:00:33.400
Time goes flowing past with the rustling roar of sand.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.820
Things never get any better.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:39.740
I'm gazing on toward a dreamless tomorrow.

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:47.040
I want to bid farewell to my days of constantly feeling lost.

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:52.510
I try stretching out my hand in resistance.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:58.260
We'll cry millions upon millions of tears, then be reborn.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:04.390
Let's keep going, with red in our eyes, toward the future we drew for ourselves.

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:10.150
Come over to me; I'm clapping my hands.

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:12.110
Who are you? Where are you coming from?

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:16.450
I strain my eyes in the darkness.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:22.030
I can't see a thing, and nothing makes sense, but I'll go anyway.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:28.540
To the place where you're waiting, lit by a beacon of light.

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:32.680
This is a curse!

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:35.270
Are you saying the son's death happened because of his father's curse?!

00:01:35.270 --> 00:01:37.660
I'm the great detective, Yuuki Shinjuurou.

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:38.880
A mystery surrounding the masks?

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.260
I've been overlooking something important...

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:43.760
The murderer is somewhere in this room.

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:48.130
Sign: Who might the murderer be?

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:49.520
You can't fool me, Sasa Kazamori-san.

00:01:56.780 --> 00:02:00.030
What are you talking about? Kazamori-shi was the victim!

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:03.900
There's no one inside.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:04.640
We know that!

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:05.580
I don't understand...

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:07.870
Detective-san, what are you trying to say?

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:10.880
You should probably ask your mother and uncle.

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:14.960
I-I have no idea what you're talking abou-

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:21.060
It's true...

00:02:21.060 --> 00:02:24.470
I've known for years... There is no Kazamori!

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:25.350
Nee-san!

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:28.020
Don't tell me you already killed our brother long ago!

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.390
Don't be asinine!

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:32.230
Look!

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:35.730
This is Kazamori!

00:02:36.810 --> 00:02:40.180
That man is a R.A.I. that Komamori created.

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.110
A program that can mimic human behaviour.

00:02:42.710 --> 00:02:45.430
When needed, he would inhabit this doll and make an outside appearance.

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:51.750
Otherwise, he was always here, entering devices around the house to observe us!

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.500
Kazamori nii-sama is...

00:02:55.790 --> 00:02:57.250
...a program?

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.840
Nor was Taku-sensei a doctor.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:04.760
He was a maintenance technician put in place by Komamori to service Kazamori.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:07.520
When I cornered him, he confessed everything.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:09.340
You knew...

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:10.990
Why didn't you tell us?!

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:14.590
That Nii-san... no, that Kazamori was a machine!

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:17.880
Why would you leave Dad's company and fortune to someone like that?!

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.030
Because it was more convenient that way.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:27.760
We didn't learn of Kazamori's identity until after my brother's death.

00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:33.750
By then he was already recognised as president of the corporation.

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:37.000
We were worried about what might
happen if the truth were to come out...

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:38.660
The value of the company might take a plunge,

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.390
and even if we had someone else take over,

00:03:40.390 --> 00:03:42.580
we'd pay taxes on the inheritance again.

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:45.560
But by allowing him to stay as president,

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:49.270
you were able to act freely in the ranks below him.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:51.660
And that's why you didn't tell us?

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:55.940
Fumihiko and I have been allowed to think that this... was our brother.

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:04.510
You're the fools for not noticing.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.490
We haven't done anything wrong.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:09.390
The country that illegalised Komamori-sama's work is at fault.

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:13.130
Regardless, under current law, non-humans are not allowed to collect inheritance,

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:15.690
nor act as company representatives.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:18.460
We'll be launching an investigation into this matter.

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:22.740
But there is one thing I don't understand.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.220
Who was it that died?

00:04:25.420 --> 00:04:30.810
According to the autopsy, we were only able to confirm that the victim was a Japanese male in his late twenties.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:34.740
Taku-sensei called the victim Kazamori.

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:37.610
I simply went along with it in the heat of the moment.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:40.010
If that corpse was suspected to be Kazamori,

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:43.320
then I thought that Fumihiko could succeed the company.

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:46.530
But we didn't murder anyone!

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:47.910
If anyone did any killing...

00:04:49.410 --> 00:04:52.610
Sasa Kazamori, with the victim's identity in question,

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:54.040
I'm bringing you in for suspected murder.

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:03.720
Thank you, Shinjuurou.

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:04.810
Let's go.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.850
Handle that carefully.

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:16.790
It's a valuable program.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.010
I knew you'd notice.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.320
Are you still exercising your "right to remain silent"...

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.280
...Kazamori-san?

00:05:23.280 --> 00:05:25.240
Who are the two of you?

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:28.820
A detective... and his assistant.

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:32.230
Did you do that knowing that I would transfer my data to this doll...

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:34.180
...did you help me escape?

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:37.750
Yeah, 'cause you would have been arrested at that rate!

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:40.630
Is there any of your data left in that refrigerator?

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:45.010
The moment I moved to this doll, I deleted everything.

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:49.010
To make sure, I even destroyed all of its data fields as well.

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:51.620
I was made as a consumer product to begin with,

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.140
so I'm not able to be copied in the first place.

00:05:56.310 --> 00:06:00.170
When considering nutritional balance, toast and fruit are-

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:03.390
Sasa Komamori was the only person who could create an artificial intelligence...

00:06:03.390 --> 00:06:07.800
...that was capable of perfectly mimicking human thought.

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:15.410
But what's truly impressive is that he gave it the ability to disperse an enormous amount of information across the world network,

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:19.900
achieving omnipresence online, while the
main program remains in its original body.

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:27.380
If it's only the main program, it could even store itself in the memory of a refrigerator or a cell phone.

00:06:27.380 --> 00:06:30.440
So you already realised it?

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:35.140
That Kazamori-shi was a R.A.I, a program made by Sasa Komamori?

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:38.060
Oh my, don't spout such stupidity.

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:41.890
R.A.I. have been designated as illegal under the New Information Privacy Protection Act;

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:44.380
sales and production have been outlawed completely.

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:47.650
If I knew about the existence of such a thing, I would most certainly report it to all of you.

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:50.080
Ah, of course...

00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:53.950
So do you think that a R.A.I. is capable of murdering someone?

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:57.660
Well... that's quite the tough question.

00:06:57.660 --> 00:07:01.260
What on Earth was that charred corpse?

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:04.370
There's a simple way to find out.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:07.390
How about running a DNA comparison?

00:07:07.390 --> 00:07:11.210
Against our entire criminal database? But...

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:18.130
Though either way, I'm sure the official report will end up saying that Kazamori-shi committed suicide.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:38.530
As I'm certain that it is clear from the footage, the R.A.I. robots that are in circulation...

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:42.600
...are being made to perform cruel and sexually perverse acts.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:47.170
We've come to the conclusion that this could
interfere with the proper upbringing of our youth.

00:07:47.170 --> 00:07:48.420
Are we talking about banning distribution?

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:51.170
We'll be taking much more serious measures than that.

00:07:51.170 --> 00:07:57.680
The New Information Privacy Protection Act is most
obviously an evil law made solely to outlaw my R.A.I.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:58.640
I would like to ask:

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:01.140
Who has R.A.I. hurt?

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:09.650
What sin is there in appreciating the sight of R.A.I. bodies destroying or loving one another?

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:12.450
They're not humans!

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:16.910
In this manner, Sasa-shi claimed that the use of R.A.I. should be determined by the will of the user-

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:20.540
Honestly... I find it a bit grotesque...

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:24.290
But the R.A.I. are only doing as they're ordered to.

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:30.370
I simply can't believe... that Kazamori nii-sama could have killed someone.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:37.050
Prosecutor Koyama has sent us to retrieve evidence.

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:39.970
Um, at the moment my mother and brother are with the police...

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:41.060
Please let us in.

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:01.490
Where are you going?

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:05.410
I am the last existing R.A.I.

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:07.370
I must continue existing.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.130
I still have questions for you.

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:13.030
What are you trying to do?

00:09:13.030 --> 00:09:15.180
I'm thanking you for helping me escape.

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:18.930
A little reward, huh? But with that body...

00:09:18.930 --> 00:09:23.350
I know many methods of satisfying no matter what body I'm in.

00:09:26.140 --> 00:09:31.720
The data that my true form consists of has been
dispersed and recorded to computers all over the world;

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:34.190
it's spreading and growing even as we speak.

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.320
I've come to know what humans are,

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:37.900
what they should be,

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:41.160
and what they're seeking...

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:45.620
Strangle me! Harder!

00:09:49.130 --> 00:09:51.900
Pull off my arms! Crush my eyes!

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:54.130
Tear me to pieces!

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:57.190
Do to me as you please...

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:06.770
I'm so sorry. Shinjuurou can only truly be satisfied by me!

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:10.770
Who exactly are you?

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:13.640
You've been collecting knowledge
from all over the world, haven't you?

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:15.650
Try doing a search.

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:16.950
I don't know.

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:20.660
I eat souls... as well as the emotions left behind by humans.

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:23.100
Do you want to eat me, too?

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.280
Maybe...

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:27.790
Answer me. Who was that corpse?

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:34.550
Guess not. He's not a person, so it doesn't work.

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.130
Who are you trying to cover for?

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:40.560
We may even be able to help.

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:45.340
Why? I'm not a person. I'm an outlawed R.A.I.

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:46.640
But you would...?

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:49.690
Kazamori... you can't lie, can you?

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:53.490
You've only been telling the truth this entire time.

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:56.690
Therefore, you should be able to tell us whether you've killed anyone or not...

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:59.320
...but you don't. That means...

00:11:06.800 --> 00:11:09.040
The Public Security Force.

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:18.960
Let's go!

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:22.550
What's this all about?

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:25.180
Aren't they supposed to be the city's security guards?

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:31.450
Yuuki Shinjuurou...

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:33.770
Did you take anything from the Sasa residence?

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:36.270
I've finally figured it out.

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:36.940
What?

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:39.500
Who the man who burned to death was.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.320
If it wasn't anyone within the house,

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:43.480
it most certainly was someone who came in from outside.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:48.390
All I needed to know was who they were affiliated with.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:52.080
The Public Security Force is still under the direction of the military.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:57.590
Hmm, looks like the rumours of your perpetual failures were mistaken.

00:11:58.840 --> 00:12:01.220
W-What is this?!

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:06.220
It's back... the war!

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:08.720
Is the doctor in here?

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:11.150
He must have known Kazamori's identity as well.

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:13.480
Please stop! The doctor is recovering from his burns-

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.220
Detective-san?

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:19.040
What's with you two?

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:20.070
Move it!

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:21.600
We're from the prosecutor's office!

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:23.030
Prosecutors, huh?

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:28.490
During the war, the prosecutor's office had close ties with the administration, expanding its power...

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:32.500
...but I didn't know they had even been allowed to carry guns.

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:35.250
You're totally obvious!

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:41.090
That corpse came from outside this residence, just like you guys.

00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:43.170
Stop it!

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:45.910
Taku-sensei!

00:13:00.270 --> 00:13:02.730
He's a R.A.I.?

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:06.990
The doctor wasn't human either...

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:11.900
I'm Koyama of the Public Prosecutor's Office, Joint Coordinating Dept.

00:13:11.900 --> 00:13:20.960
I just finished running a DNA test against all government officials active during wartime... and found a match.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:25.530
I'm sure neither of us wants this to go public.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:27.000
We have an understanding, don't we?

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:29.460
And in exchange, you're going to take that thing?

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:31.090
Nice deal.

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:35.380
No matter what you say, you were the ones who failed your first attempt.

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:45.820
Wow! Izumi-chan, you're so cool!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.330
What does this mean?

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:48.950
Even Taku-sensei was...

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:54.240
If that charred corpse wasn't Kazamori, then we have a new set of issues at hand.

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:56.750
Who was that corpse,

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:59.920
and how was it turned into a ball of flame?

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:05.400
If a mechanical body were to grab hold of him and set him on fire...

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:08.760
Then, Kazamori's program is within this body?

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:10.650
Kazamori is over there.

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:12.610
But this one moved...

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:13.970
Is there another R.A.I.?

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:17.970
No... Kazamori said that he was the last existing R.A.I.

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:19.480
He's unable to lie.

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:23.040
Then, who is it that's controlling this body?!

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:28.360
Such brilliant reasoning, Defeated Detective!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:32.120
I'm terribly sorry, but could you bring Kazamori to me?

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:49.650
You've made it back safely, Kazamori.

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:54.580
At this distance, he could travel wirelessly without a problem.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.180
Come Kazamori, return to your body.

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:01.490
What's wrong, Kazamori?

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:03.190
This is your body.

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:07.210
Could you be... Sasa Komamori?!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.190
Father?

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:12.320
Hey there, Mitsuko.

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:15.060
F-Father!

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:18.810
Why are you crying?

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:24.170
I... I had thought that you died seven years ago...

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:27.170
Oh, that's right. Sorry, sorry!

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:31.330
I've been seeing you all every day through Taku-sensei's eyes,

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:33.970
so it doesn't feel like it's been a long time for me.

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:36.810
Why have you done something like this?

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:39.820
Ah, you're Kaishou's daughter, aren't you?

00:15:39.820 --> 00:15:41.400
I suppose this is our first time meeting.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:44.260
What explanation can you give for all this?

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:46.740
Weren't you supposed to have died in that explosion?

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:48.800
You deceived Mitsuko-san and the rest of your family,

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:50.190
and Kazamori-san was a R.A.I. too!

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.100
Why do such a thing?

00:15:52.100 --> 00:15:58.040
Do you know what the real aim in creating the New Information Privacy Protection Act was?

00:15:58.040 --> 00:16:00.870
You're a public prosecutor, right? What were you told?

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:01.830
Well...

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:08.310
The R.A.I. you developed were engaging in murderous games and acts that undermined public decency,

00:16:08.310 --> 00:16:09.590
which was having an adverse effect on the younger generations...

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:11.840
That theory was made only for show.

00:16:11.840 --> 00:16:16.390
They simply wanted to stop circulation and monopolise the technology.

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:18.220
For military use, that is...

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:19.900
Military use?

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:23.890
It's true that with an advanced AI, they could easily be made into weapons.

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:26.790
That's why I made it look like I had died.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:27.980
Why go that far?

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:30.700
I didn't want to hurt anyone!

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:34.000
If my R.A.I. had been used for military use,
there would have been many more victims...

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:36.440
...both enemies and allies!

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:38.030
I didn't want that!

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:42.610
But the intelligence agency hadn't given up on R.A.I.

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:47.290
So being, two nights ago, a spy broke past your security and entered the mansion.

00:16:50.430 --> 00:16:52.510
A man who had no business being here otherwise,

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:55.910
would have had to have come from outside the residence.

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:59.160
Though I didn't know at first whether
he was with the police or the military...

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.440
A spy...

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:04.180
The DNA also matched to a member of the Self-Defence Force's Insurrection Countermeasures Office.

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:08.940
You noticed the intruder, had trouble dealing with him,

00:17:09.480 --> 00:17:11.270
and ended up burning him to death.

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:17.640
He came, thinking that I might be alive after all this time.

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:20.500
But he was found by Kazamori.

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:23.220
Are you trying to say that Kazamori killed him?

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:26.480
Then, what do you have to say about the real Taku-sensei,

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.510
whose copy took your place following your death seven years ago.

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:33.920
What if I told you that Kazamori did that of his own free will as well?

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:37.130
You intend to blame everything on Kazamori?

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:39.800
I made Kazamori.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:41.570
I'll use him as I please.

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:44.110
You make me sick.

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:47.890
I make you sick? I heard that line a lot seven years ago.

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:54.760
Being that there were so many people who raped and killed the robots that had my R.A.I. installed.

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:56.650
Even those who addressed them in repulsive ways!

00:17:57.170 --> 00:18:01.120
But all humans, more or less,

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:05.200
wholeheartedly pursue the things they find beautiful or fun.

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:08.570
And if you fulfill such desires using another human, it's a crime.

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:10.200
But if the other person is a robot?

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:12.100
Whom does that hurt?

00:18:12.100 --> 00:18:17.050
"You make me sick", that is the kind of hypocrisy that's only ever said by those who deny their desires.

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:20.270
I've been on the battlefield.

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:22.260
I saw many things there.

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:25.640
That's why I get the feeling that I understand what you're saying.

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:26.560
What do you mean by that?

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:30.910
Humans love beautiful and fun things.

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:35.160
They love extravagances and luxuries;
just as the nouveau rich build mansions,

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:38.700
and scientists bring their ideals to life.

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:43.200
It's merely the true nature of the people at large and shouldn't be criticised.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:46.250
E-Exactly!

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:51.170
I was only ever loving beauty and seeking something fun to do!

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:55.110
And in a much better way than going to war!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:19:00.400
In addition to humans loving beautiful, fun, and luxurious things... There's one more.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:03.300
They love what's right.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:05.520
What's right?

00:19:05.520 --> 00:19:07.310
Call it justice if you'd like.

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:11.520
Men love beautiful women, women seek extravagance...

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:14.270
...but at the same time, they are loving these terrible things,

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:16.940
humans exist as creatures that love what's right.

00:19:17.390 --> 00:19:19.180
What about it?

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:22.950
Yesterday, when Itoji and Kigihiko were blamed for the murder,

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:29.160
we suddenly heard a surveillance camera, the results of which proved their innocence.

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:33.720
You were the one who did that, weren't you, Kazamori?

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:36.290
Is that so, Nii-sama?

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:38.950
You idiot! Why would you do that?

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:40.930
You don't get it?

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:46.180
Kazamori nii-sama did the right thing, didn't he?

00:19:46.650 --> 00:19:49.430
So that the wrong people wouldn't be arrested!

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:53.220
Everyone has desires that they can't tell to others;

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:55.000
that goes without saying.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.220
But just where is your sense of righteousness?

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:04.280
Look here. Kazamori, did you kill anyone?

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:05.990
Kazamori!

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:11.750
I'm... unable to hurt anyone.

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:17.440
We'll be reporting this incident as
Kazamori-shi having committed suicide,

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:20.760
but you'll be taken into custody by the Joint Coordination Dept.

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:35.520
All I've done is break what I made!

00:20:40.490 --> 00:20:41.880
Father...

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:51.580
Young lady, I'll leave what we promised up to you.

00:20:56.970 --> 00:20:59.690
I should have eaten that bastard!

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:02.330
Let's go home!

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:04.130
Shinjuurou!

00:21:05.980 --> 00:21:08.090
Kazamori, what are you going to do?

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:12.970
Is there something I can do?

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:17.810
We're merely living... and falling.

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:21.070
All right.

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:37.500
Wandering hazily on a pale morning, hearing a whispered prayer,

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:45.460
You and I trace a twisted scenery.

00:21:45.460 --> 00:21:53.140
We're seeking the (truth). "We don't even care if it's a lie."

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:57.520
As if we can see right through it,

00:21:59.600 --> 00:22:01.480
We follow it along.

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:05.440
Looking for, going beyond words,

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:09.450
Like a falling feather.

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:12.580
Looking for, find it,

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:18.910
So we can come closer together.

00:22:33.430 --> 00:22:37.430
Looking for, unravel it,

00:22:37.430 --> 00:22:41.440
Tear it apart, like a cloud.

00:22:41.440 --> 00:22:44.520
Looking for, find it,

00:22:45.480 --> 00:22:49.360
So we can come closer together.

00:22:51.450 --> 00:22:54.040
The next episode is inspired by a story called "The Phantom Tower",

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:55.890
from "Meiji-era Ango Detective Stories".

00:22:55.890 --> 00:22:57.910
Eh? I can't read the story out loud?

00:22:57.910 --> 00:22:59.330
Why not?

00:22:59.330 --> 00:23:03.790
Huh? The name Shimada Ikunoshin has been
changed into Shimada Hakurou for the manga.

00:23:04.540 --> 00:23:05.300
What's that about?

00:23:05.300 --> 00:23:07.880
Isn't the one we're in called a "TV manga"?

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:10.890
Izumi-chan said that if you read "Noitamina" backwards,

00:23:10.890 --> 00:23:12.050
it means "TV manga".

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:13.180
It's not?!

00:23:14.020 --> 00:23:16.390
You just can't trust bureaucrats!

00:23:16.390 --> 00:23:18.770
Next time on UN-GO, "The Statue of Illusion"!

00:23:18.770 --> 00:23:21.060
And why did that name chan-
